## Output

### Artifacts

- `sql/01-roles.sql` — Role creation and hierarchy (GRANT ROLE)
- `sql/02-masking-policies.sql` — Masking policy DDL (CREATE MASKING POLICY)
{% if has_row_access | default(false) -%}
- `sql/03-row-access-policies.sql` — Row access policy DDL
{% endif -%}
- `sql/04-apply-policies.sql` — ALTER TABLE ... SET MASKING POLICY
- `sql/05-grants.sql` — Object-level GRANT statements

### Execution Order

Artifacts must be executed in numbered order (roles before policies before grants).

